ot skip this step when .NET APIs appear in your findings.\\n8. **Treat `_guides` as out of scope** — do not recommend edits in the `_guides` collection. If the best structural answer appears to require `_guides`, call that out explicitly as a follow-up item for a different workflow while keeping your recommended changes inside `_documentation`.\"}"
